# Contact

Want to learn with Allen? Send an email and include these lines. That is enough to start — no form, no account needed.

**Email: [spritenee@gmail.com](mailto:spritenee@gmail.com)**

Please include:

1. **What you want to learn** — Chinese, Tai Chi, or both?
2. **Your level** — complete beginner, can say a few sentences, can read some characters, or intermediate? For Tai Chi: never tried it, tried a little, or already practising?
3. **Why you are learning** — travel, work, family, heritage, health, interest in Chinese culture, or something else?
4. **How you found this site** — search, YouTube, a friend, or somewhere else?

You can also find Allen here:

- YouTube: https://youtube.com/spritenee
- Facebook: https://facebook.com/spritenee
- X: https://twitter.com/spritenee

> Everything on this site — lessons, articles, Tai Chi guides, and news explanations — is free for now. Course collections and one-to-one online lessons are not offered yet; they will come later, once the Chinese, Tai Chi, and news sections have built up. For now, this email is for following along, asking a question, or telling Allen what you would like to learn. Nothing on this page promises a specific course, schedule, or result.
